6 0 obj
<< /Length 689 >>
stream
BT
/F1 14.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 750.40 Tm (5.2 TCC) Tj
/F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 736.40 Tm (TCC splits work into Try, Confirm and Cancel business operations.) Tj
/F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 722.40 Tm (It moves the lock from database rows to business resources and needs idempotency.) Tj
/F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 708.40 Tm (Try reserves inventory or credit, Confirm consumes the reservation and Cancel releases it.) Tj
/F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 694.40 Tm (Empty rollback protection matters: Cancel may arrive before Try when the network reorders requests.) Tj
/F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 680.40 Tm (Suspension is required when a Cancel arrives while Try is still running, otherwise the resource leaks.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
